%%{ init: { "sequence": { "mirrorActors": false, "actorMargin": 80 } } }%%
sequenceDiagram
    title Tenant Invitation Flow

    participant Manager as Property Manager
    participant App as Manager Dashboard
    participant API as API Server
    participant EdgeFn as Edge Function
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant Email as Email Service
    participant SMS as SMS Gateway

    Manager->>App: Navigate to Tenants → Invite
    App-->>Manager: Show invitation form

    Manager->>App: Fill: Name, Phone, Unit, Rent, Move-in
    App->>API: POST /send-tenant-invitation
    API->>EdgeFn: Invoke edge function

    EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Validate input
    EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Validate phone (Kenyan format)
    EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Generate idempotency key

    EdgeFn->>DB: Check for existing tenant
    DB-->>EdgeFn: No existing tenant

    EdgeFn->>DB: Create invitation record
    DB-->>EdgeFn: Invitation created (expires in 14 days)

    EdgeFn->>DB: Generate unique invitation ID
    DB-->>EdgeFn: Invitation ID

    alt Phone available (send SMS)
        EdgeFn->>SMS: Send SMS with invitation link
        SMS-->>EdgeFn: SMS sent
    end

    alt Email available
        EdgeFn->>Email: Send invitation email
        Email-->>EdgeFn: Email sent
    end

    EdgeFn-->>API: 201 Created (invitation ID)
    API-->>Manager: Success: Invitation sent

    Note over Tenant,EdgeFn: Tenant receives SMS/Email

    Tenant->>Tenant: Click invitation link
    Tenant->>API: GET /tenant/signup?invitation_id=xxx
    API->>EdgeFn: Validate invitation

    EdgeFn->>DB: Fetch invitation
    DB-->>EdgeFn: Invitation details

    alt Invitation valid and not expired
        EdgeFn-->>API: Invitation valid
        API-->>Tenant: Show signup form with pre-filled details
    else Invitation expired/cancelled
        EdgeFn-->>API: 410 Gone
        API-->>Tenant: Error: Invitation expired
    end

    Tenant->>API: POST /tenant/signup (accept invitation)
    API->>EdgeFn: Create tenant account
    EdgeFn->>DB: Create auth user
    DB-->>EdgeFn: User created

    EdgeFn->>DB: Create tenant profile
    EdgeFn->>DB: Update invitation status
    EdgeFn->>DB: Create lease record

    EdgeFn->>DB: Generate first rent invoice
    DB-->>EdgeFn: Invoice created

    EdgeFn-->>API: 201 Created
    API-->>Tenant: Account created, redirect to portal

    EdgeFn->>Manager: Notify: Tenant signed up
    EdgeFn->>SMS: Send welcome message to tenant
